### Workflows App — DTS Backend
### See README.md for setup instructions.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@workflowComponent = dts
@instanceId = order-003

### Start a PlaceOrder workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/PlaceOrder/{{instanceId}}

### Get workflow status
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Send events to the PlaceOrder workflow (send in order)
### -------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Change the purchase item
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}/ChangePurchaseItem/stapler

### 2. Confirm size, color, and address (all three required — WhenAll)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmSize/large

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmColor/red

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}/ConfirmAddress/123-Main-St

### 3. Choose a payment method (any one of these — WhenAny)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RaiseWorkflowEvent/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}/PayByCard/visa

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Monitor workflow
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Start a second PlaceOrder workflow to be monitored
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/PlaceOrder/order-002

### Start a monitor that watches order-002
POST {{baseUrl}}/StartMonitorWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/order-002/monitor-001

### Get monitor status
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{workflowComponent}}/monitor-001

### -------------------------------------------------------
### Lifecycle operations
### -------------------------------------------------------

### Pause a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/PauseWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}

### Resume a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResumeWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}

### Terminate a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/TerminateWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}

### Purge a workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/PurgeWorkflow/{{workflowComponent}}/{{instanceId}}
